# Keep the build context small and keep host artefacts out of images. A host
# .venv copied into a Linux image is broken and confusing; node_modules is
# large and platform-specific.
#
# Patterns here are anchored to the context root, so `node_modules/` alone
# would match only a top-level one and miss frontend/node_modules - which is
# most of the context. Hence the ** prefixes.

.git/
.github/

**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/*.egg-info/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.vite/

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/*.db
**/*.sqlite3

README.md
